definite integral\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{5}\\sqrt{x-1}\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nthe function is $f(x)=\\sqrt{x-1},$ the lower bound is $a=1,$ and the upper bound is $b=5.$ So, we have\n\n$$\nΔx=\\frac{5-1}{n}=\\frac{4}{n},\n$$\n\nand therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}\\sqrt{x-1}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{i})\\cdot Δx \\\\  & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[f(1+i\\cdot \\frac{4}{n})\\,\\cdot \\frac{4}{n}] \\\\  & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[f(1+\\frac{4i}{n})\\cdot \\frac{4}{n}] \\\\  & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[\\sqrt{1+\\frac{4i}{n}-1}\\cdot \\frac{4}{n}] \\\\  & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[\\sqrt{\\frac{4i}{n}}\\cdot \\frac{4}{n}] \\\\  & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[\\sqrt{\\frac{i}{n}}\\cdot \\frac{8}{n}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/answer-fields ["q-113886/selection/ma-v1/39f15709d839658c31318905fab145675284a20b9f85b08d39e5f729c216bcbc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-113918/selection/8548bd60179d299eff7d6747f28965504d3f34e77b39a1393c83c8f18ac5f2ff" :answer/id #uuid "e939d2bc-48b6-5dd7-9f9b-bc0f3c9d5c2a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)={e}^{2x}$ and $b=3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113918/selection/42425508260aaac0bb9b75c117f5aa70006afc090bdfbbaf7626176060efe58c" :answer/id #uuid "f9540f1c-dc4c-562f-995d-b19d8e72373d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)={e}^{6x}$ and $b=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113918/selection/cd2f4f1ba4b85266177b8d2de99c4fd5e2a46a1fa3e4a1887198aa78a4362d72" :answer/id #uuid "13795126-5909-5c2b-9dc5-2450f739e71d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)={e}^{x}$ and $b=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113918/selection/284e335524189faa6f766ad48fcb3df16b33ea88eeb30a8546fc0d07ba5a1687" :answer/id #uuid "d5661740-8911-5489-8656-11af23a612bc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)={e}^{x}$ and $b=6$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113918/selection/18c8c2e802b239aec5e0068b977dd2e986ca2cb9cfb472d5337b8d531de74d73" :answer/id #uuid "3bb635d2-8d79-5ce9-b2ee-eb3d34326f71" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)={e}^{6x}$ and $b=6$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113918/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3a81c35b-ade7-5ac5-a9bd-4f5f4f943d3f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-113918/selection/284e335524189faa6f766ad48fcb3df16b33ea88eeb30a8546fc0d07ba5a1687" :answer-field/choices ["q-113918/selection/8548bd60179d299eff7d6747f28965504d3f34e77b39a1393c83c8f18ac5f2ff" "q-113918/selection/42425508260aaac0bb9b75c117f5aa70006afc090bdfbbaf7626176060efe58c" "q-113918/selection/cd2f4f1ba4b85266177b8d2de99c4fd5e2a46a1fa3e4a1887198aa78a4362d72" "q-113918/selection/284e335524189faa6f766ad48fcb3df16b33ea88eeb30a8546fc0d07ba5a1687" "q-113918/selection/18c8c2e802b239aec5e0068b977dd2e986ca2cb9cfb472d5337b8d531de74d73"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-113918" :question/id #uuid "c2081a2b-f662-517d-bd66-e0ddf60008b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-113918" :question/problem "Find the function $f(x)$ and the value of $b,$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[{e}^{6i/n}\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}].$" :question/worked-solution "A definite integral can be defined as the limit of a left Riemann sum as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{i})\\cdot Δx\n$$\n\nwhere $Δx=\\frac{b-a}{n}$ and ${x}_{i}=a+iΔx.$\n\nNotice that we're given that the lower limit $a=0.$ \n\nComparing the given summation with the general expression above, we see that $Δx=\\frac{6}{n}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{6}{n}=\\frac{b-0}{n}\\,⟹\\,b=6.\n$$\n\nConsequently,  ${x}_{i}=\\frac{6i}{n}$ and $f({x}_{i})={e}^{{x}_{i}}.$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{6}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[{e}^{6i/n}\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $f(x)={e}^{x}$ and $b=6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-113918/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4f663b0b-9b5e-512c-92bb-0ea84d5baac5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113918"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113917/selection/8ed8e90dca6e3b8c994b61ca4c7e60599ed440b4485ece770070606452f5d057" :answer/id #uuid "b8049523-5f74-5db8-a4d8-5bca276db9f7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x$ and $b=2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113917/selection/098e410ace27d09808f28399fb44e569929ffac41d21e83f6b70c5d38ba4b9a9" :answer/id #uuid "fce448cc-8877-5522-b441-fc2e7683132a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $b=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113917/selection/0ef55d300b84865f1457e0595a1429ea56c0f1d0282e63407f6822dfa0473627" :answer/id #uuid "b20db7ed-0ebc-52f7-b8b9-2cd94e8dd607" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x$ and $b=2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113917/selection/eb36f96a17075208c4f00f0ce740e731de44db17e746aa0be5e073a0edcd9a50" :answer/id #uuid "98553cab-2b3d-57c1-bebf-33fe1975bd2f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $b=2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113917/selection/a81243f554d5503ef9b640febe9257819558e7bb1768a062b6018e7497b23f90" :answer/id #uuid "e44fd72d-70e2-5290-a973-b6d30cb08334" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x$ and $b=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113917/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "63ca64c2-8dbf-58db-ac83-188fd320e192" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-113917/selection/eb36f96a17075208c4f00f0ce740e731de44db17e746aa0be5e073a0edcd9a50" :answer-field/choices ["q-113917/selection/8ed8e90dca6e3b8c994b61ca4c7e60599ed440b4485ece770070606452f5d057" "q-113917/selection/098e410ace27d09808f28399fb44e569929ffac41d21e83f6b70c5d38ba4b9a9" "q-113917/selection/0ef55d300b84865f1457e0595a1429ea56c0f1d0282e63407f6822dfa0473627" "q-113917/selection/eb36f96a17075208c4f00f0ce740e731de44db17e746aa0be5e073a0edcd9a50" "q-113917/selection/a81243f554d5503ef9b640febe9257819558e7bb1768a062b6018e7497b23f90"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-113917" :question/id #uuid "4121c061-0943-55e1-8348-ce5b51dbf815" :question/math-academy-id "q-113917" :question/problem "Find the function $f(x)$ and the value of $b,$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2k}{n})\\cdot \\frac{2}{n}].$" :question/worked-solution "A definite integral can be defined as the limit of a left Riemann sum as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{k})\\cdot Δx\n$$\n\nwhere $Δx=\\frac{b-a}{n}$ and ${x}_{k}=a+kΔx.$\n\nNotice that we're given that the lower limit $a=0.$ \n\nComparing the given summation with the general expression above, we see that $Δx=\\frac{2}{n}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{n}=\\frac{b-0}{n}\\,⟹\\,b=2.\n$$\n\nConsequently,  ${x}_{k}=\\frac{2k}{n}$ and $f({x}_{k})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡{x}_{k}.$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2k}{n})\\cdot \\frac{2}{n}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $b=2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-113917/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4f663b0b-9b5e-512c-92bb-0ea84d5baac5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113917"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-346204/field-1/98ff68dfa72eb7e5cf84ded6c7547e06379815dce7e0a1e777eb4696