emann sum as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{k})\\cdot Δx\n$$\n\nwhere $Δx=\\frac{b-a}{n}$ and ${x}_{k}=a+kΔx.$\n\nNotice that we're given that the lower limit $a=2.$ \n\nComparing the given summation with the general expression above, we see that $Δx=\\frac{3}{n}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{n}=\\frac{b-2}{n}\\,⟹\\,b=5.\n$$\n\nConsequently, ${x}_{k}=2+\\frac{3k}{n}$ and $f({x}_{k})=\\sqrt{{x}_{k}}.$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{2}^{5}\\sqrt{x}\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{k=0}^{n-1}[\\sqrt{2+\\frac{3k}{n}}\\cdot \\frac{3}{n}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \n\n$$\nf(x)=\\sqrt{x}\\,\\text{and}\\,b=5.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-346204/field-1" "q-346204/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4f663b0b-9b5e-512c-92bb-0ea84d5baac5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-346204"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186261476 :question/answer-fields 17592186274961] {:db/id "q-73178/selection/ma-v1/cae4b3cbfe9c6697fc46cef3bdaadf104b73f94653a57c2d2c8c034ada288865/d9e6a7a013c8711216ffc0e5a16e17b49401c9fc783b4183d5ecb43fce35faf4" :answer/id #uuid "fc2e4ad0-d60e-5be6-83bd-b06c8491188f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)={sec}^{2}⁡x$ and $b=\\frac{\\pi }{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73178/selection/ma-v1/cae4b3cbfe9c6697fc46cef3bdaadf104b73f94653a57c2d2c8c034ada288865/ef260c4a4cfd980043f31b70fe4ce8f60ec673527a7056ec195ef25c382c7f6c" :answer/id #uuid "85649e47-8569-5ade-bb69-b89a734da890" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$f(x)={sec}^{2}⁡x$ and $b=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73178/selection/ma-v1/cae4b3cbfe9c6697fc46cef3bdaadf104b73f94653a57c2d2c8c034ada288865/82627d043273f3d26d28d7af45e784a17863a6ed859e32c69dea65e52bfdce21" :answer/id #uuid "48e88ef6-36b5-5f68-aaf2-889636a8f998" :answer/type :answer.ty